  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read `Spaarke.DailyBriefing.Components` package structure — package.json, tsconfig.json, src/ layout.</step>
    <step order="2">Decide final package name. Recommend `@spaarke/legal-workspace`. Confirm with existing naming conventions (grep other `Spaarke.*` packages). Folder: `src/client/shared/Spaarke.LegalWorkspace/` (recommend).</step>
    <step order="3">Create folder structure: `src/client/shared/Spaarke.LegalWorkspace/{package.json, tsconfig.json, src/index.ts, .storybook/ (if analogue has one)}`.</step>
    <step order="4">Populate `package.json` — copy DailyBriefing's shape, rename to `@spaarke/legal-workspace`, update description, adjust dependencies (React + Fluent v9; may add dependency on `@spaarke/ui-components`).</step>
    <step order="5">Populate `tsconfig.json` — mirror DailyBriefing's compile options + paths.</step>
    <step order="6">Empty `src/index.ts` with a comment `// Populated by task 021 (FR-10 section registry migration)`.</step>
    <step order="7">Run `npm run build` in the new package — types emit; empty index.ts builds successfully.</step>
    <step order="8">Update TASK-INDEX.md: 020 → ✅.</step>
  </steps>

